  "contentPlaintext": "<bold>Client Meeting Notes</bold>\nThis standard log captures client feedback, technical approvals, and newly requested action items from formal stakeholder review sessions.\n<bold>1. Table of Contents</bold>\n1. Table of Contents\n2. Session Metadata\n3. Discussion Agenda & Key Updates\n3.1 Deliverable Review\n3.2 Client Feedback & Iterations\n4. Official Approvals & Sign-Offs\n5. Action Items & Board Task Mapping\n<bold>2. Session Metadata</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Client Organization:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Client Company Name]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Meeting Date / Time:</textStyle></bold> May 28, 2026 | [Insert Time]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Session Tracking ID:</textStyle></bold> MTG-CLIENT-[001-999]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Meeting Facilitator:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Project Manager Name]\n<bold>Attendance Roll Call</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Project Manager (Owner):</textStyle></bold> [Name / Present or Absent]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Account Manager (Admin):</textStyle></bold> [Name / Present or Absent]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Tech Lead (Manager):</textStyle></bold> [Name / Present or Absent]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Team Members (Members):</textStyle></bold> [List present agency staff]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Client Stakeholders (Viewers):</textStyle></bold> [List present client representatives]\n<bold>3. Discussion Agenda & Key Updates</bold>\n<bold>3.1 Deliverable Review</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">UI Dashboard Prototypes:</textStyle></bold> The agency team presented the high-fidelity interactive wireframes and responsive data grid layouts for Phase 2 review.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Technical Performance:</textStyle></bold> Demonstrated local load simulation data showing view state updates executing well inside the <bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">300-millisecond</textStyle></bold> constraint ceiling.\n<bold>3.2 Client Feedback & Iterations</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Data Export Customization:</textStyle></bold> The client requested an update to the reporting panel to support raw CSV extraction fields alongside standard PDF files.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Scope Determination:</textStyle></bold> The Tech Lead noted that this addition is fully supported by the existing database schema, requiring no changes to the Scope of Work (SOW) budget.\n<bold>4. Official Approvals & Sign-Offs</bold>\nThis section tracks explicit client confirmations and milestone progression clearances:\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Phase 2 UI Prototypes:</textStyle></bold> Approved. The client signed off on the current design layout frames and component interaction patterns.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Phase 3 Staging Pipeline:</textStyle></bold> Pending. Work will begin on the backend microservice routes immediately following this session.\n<bold>5. Action Items & Board Task Mapping</bold>\nThese tasks must be pushed to our workspace tracking columns with their appropriate visibility tags within 12 hours:\nSpecific Technical Action Item\nAssigned Owner\nPriority Level\nTarget Taxonomy Tag\nTarget Deadline\n<italic>[e.g., Add CSV extraction logic]</italic>\n[Tech Lead]\nHigh\n<code>client-request</code>\n[Insert Date]\n<italic>[e.g., Transfer UI assets to staging]</italic>\n[Team Member]\nHigh\n<code>internal</code>\n[Insert Date]\n<italic>[e.g., Schedule Phase 3 beta review]</italic>\n[Account Manager]\nMedium\n<code>internal</code>\n[Insert Date]",
